    { "id": "O3", "text": "Agents and humans run any runnable, check or image of a project, sandboxed or on the host, as a tracked run." }
  ],
  "stories": [
    { "id": "S1", "kind": "data-flow", "text": "A monorepo with a Cargo workspace, a bun workspace and a uv workspace gives one node per project with its path and workspace edges, its lock-file dependencies and its runnables. Variations: V1 pyproject with console_scripts (success: each script a runnable); V2 package.json bin and scripts (success); V3 a manifest that does not parse (failure: a finding with the file, no partial node).", "objectives": ["O1"],
      "tests": ["test:crates/legionctl/tests/projects.rs::a_monorepo_gives_one_node_per_project_with_its_edges_dependencies_and_runnables"] },
    { "id": "S2", "text": "A Dockerfile and its container env belong to their project; images build and run per project. Variations: V1 Dockerfile outside any project (success: a repository image).", "objectives": ["O1"],
      "tests": ["test:crates/legionctl/tests/projects.rs::a_dockerfile_belongs_to_its_project_and_builds_as_its_image"] },
    { "id": "S3", "kind": "control-flow", "text": "code checks detect and run work per project and language; the gates run the checks of the projects a change touches. Variations: V1 a change in one project (success: only its checks run); V2 a project with no test kind (failure: a finding for that project).", "objectives": ["O2"],
      "tests": ["test:crates/legionctl/tests/checks.rs::checks_run_per_project_and_a_gate_runs_only_the_touched_projects"] },
    { "id": "S4", "kind": "control-flow", "text": "A runnable runs sandboxed with no approval, or on the host; an agent's host run asks the user each time; both are runs with log and result. Variations: V1 agent host run denied (failure: not started, recorded); V2 user host run from a terminal (success: no dialog); V3 sandboxed run (success: own namespace, tracked files and network).", "objectives": ["O3"],
      "tests": ["test:crates/legionctl/tests/projects.rs::a_runnable_runs_sandboxed_freely_and_on_the_host_only_with_the_users_approval"] }
  ],
